ed). A build-time version-consistency test locks the embedded line to exchange.SpecificationVersion (the standard version the conformance rules implement). ADR-020 amended (instance :3, Decision 1 carve-out) and ADR-023 position note recorded (cmt:023-skill-pack-install-command-review:1).","tests":["go test -race -count=1 ./... : all packages green (bootstrap, cmd, ui, feedback, plugin, root).","Build-time consistency verified: mutating the embedded Version line to 9.9 fails TestEmbeddedVersionMatchesConformanceRules and TestVersionStandardDerivesFromEmbeddedDeclaration; restored byte-identical.","Manual smoke: init --dry-run plans 'generate file: EKA (standard declaration)'; init writes EKA (7902 bytes, 'EKA STANDARD' / 'Version 1.0'); re-run reuses; deleted EKA backfilled; differing EKA overwrite-confirm + skip (non-interactive); eka version reports 'EKA standard 1.0'."]}